- Adding cards directly to ally hand, adding energy, or drawing cards will now un-end ally turn
- Fixed an issue where the max page counter would display '1' even when there was no lobbies displaying
- Fixed an issue where the Steam Lobby name filter would continue filtering text when the screen was reopened but the input field would be empty
