- Fixed an issue where using the seed setting or the name filter in the Blight Select, Potion Select, Relic Select, and Steam Lobby screens would disable scroll inputs for the rest of the runtime
- Fixed an issue where disconnecting with an unsupported modded character while dead would crash the game when reconnecting
- Fixed an issue where Strike effects could still appear on dead monsters
- Fixed an issue where the game could crash under really bad network connections when trading
- Dev:
    - Removed the OnPlayerChangedCard callback
