    - Renamed the OnPlayerNonFinalDeath callback from CustomMultiplayerRelic class to onDeath
    - Added the OnFFResurrected, OnResurrectAlly, OnChatMessageSent, and OnChatMessageReceived callbacks to the P2PCallbacks and CustomMultiplayerRelic classes
    - Renamed the onTraded callback from CustomMultiplayerRelic class to onTradedThisRelic for clarity purposes
    - Fixed an issue where relics implementing CustomMultiplayerRelic would have "Cannot be traded." sometimes incorrectly
